00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
There are no vocational education courses.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
There are no college courses anymore.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
There's nothing except a GED class.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
And if you already have a GED, you get nothing else.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:41.680
The CIA lied even to those of us inside the CIA, and the reports from the field said that

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:48.640
torture worked, that Albus Abedah had cracked, and that he gave us information that saved

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.960
American lives.

