00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:06.720
Just like all of NSA with the blower Tom Drake's espionage charges were dropped, because

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:10.720
very simply, I haven't committed espionage.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:14.200
This is a 1917 era law

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:17.500
that was enacted in order to target

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:22.360
German saboteurs during the First World War. It was updated very briefly in

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:23.920
