00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:29.520
But still this law is so old

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:34.320
and so broadly written that it doesn't even contain the phrase classified

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:38.720
information because the classification system had not yet been invented.

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:43.080
It discusses only national defense information.

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:47.480
